{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41157","headline":"途中诗 · 杨奇鲲","name":"途中诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n风里浪花吹更白，雨中山色洗还青。\n海鸥聚处窗前见，林狖啼时枕上听。\n此际自然无限趣，王程不敢暂留停。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨奇鲲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}